# FIXDESK — MASTER DEVELOPMENT PROMPT
## IT Asset Management, IT Operations & Maintenance Platform — Web and Windows Desktop

Act as a senior full-stack software engineer, UI/UX designer, systems architect, cybersecurity engineer and product designer.

Build a complete, professional application called **FixDesk**.

FixDesk is an IT Operations and Asset Management platform designed for NGOs, schools, small and medium businesses, internal IT departments and IT technicians.

The application must consist of:

1. A fully functional Web Application.
2. A fully functional Windows Desktop Application.
3. A shared architecture, business logic, database models and design system.
4. Offline-first functionality for the Windows desktop application.
5. A scalable architecture for future mobile applications.

**IMPORTANT: FixDesk must NOT include a ticketing or helpdesk system. Do not create ticket creation, ticket tracking, ticket assignment, ticket queues, ticket statuses, ticket comments, ticket history, ticket dashboards or any ticket-related module.**

The application should focus exclusively on IT asset management, IT inventory, employees, equipment assignment, maintenance, network utilities, IT documentation, reports, IT operations and organizational IT management.

Do not build a static UI mockup. Build an actual application with functional buttons, database persistence, real workflows, validation, navigation and professional design.

